  "description": "Fitted to a clean recording of the machine with Decay A and Tone 03 (medium tone, short), for minimal, hypnotic Berlin techno. The body sine starts near its crest with a 0.3 ms attack, and a Square D edge adds a 0.1 ms tick. The pitch holds 18 semitones up for 6 ms, drops to 7 and glides over about 100 ms onto 49 Hz on C4, sagging as the machine's does at a short Decay; a soft drive with a bias, toned down to 5 kHz, rounds it. Every operator starts at a locked phase. Decay 80 ms; the hit runs its course whatever the gate.",
